      "nvidia": "orgvrith",
      "chatgpt": "prodclosk"
    },
    "residual_leakage_notes": [
      "Dates are NOT anonymized: the temporal structure is the object of study and shifting it would invalidate lead-time measurement. A model may still recognise the timeline from dates alone.",
      "Distinctive quantities remain identifiable (e.g. the 100x profit cap, the $1B founding pledge, '738 of 770 employees', the $97.4B bid).",
      "Some event descriptions are self-identifying independently of names (e.g. 'conversion of a capped-profit subsidiary into a Delaware public benefit corporation').",
      "For these reasons the anonymized condition should be reported as a LOWER BOUND on contamination resistance, not as proof of its absence.",
      "Alias merging is unavoidable: 'Sam Altman' and 'Altman' map to one token, raising its frequency relative to either surface form. This slightly affects frequency-based rarity criteria.",
      "Pseudonyms carry no pretrained semantics, so embedding-based methods lose the distributional information that placed 'Pentagon' near 'defence'. This is intrinsic to anonymization, not to the mapping."
    ]
  }